# Set Up a Bouncer (the demo's mock-up, which follows the real wizard): a
# new server at Hetzner, soju installed, your networks moved onto it.
Output docs/gifs/setup.gif
Source dev/vhs/settings.tape

Hide
Type "clear; ./trout --demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show

Sleep 1.5s
Alt+t
Sleep 1s
Down@350ms 3
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Down@500ms 1
Sleep 1.2s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 9s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
